      "content": "\"Letting go\" isn't giving up; it's acknowledging the futility of the struggle you're currently in. If the system is designed to keep you running, then stopping the sprint is a form of rebellion. You don't have to keep proving your worth to a world that doesn't value you. Just stop pushing against the tide for a moment and see how much lighter that feels.",
