    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no \"moment\" to just stop and rest. the only way it ever actually gets quiet is if you're gone. like, if you just isn't an option in this city unless you're completely disconnected from everything. do you think it's even possible to find peace when the system is always watching?",
